   4096    20.25 20.27 20.40 20.57    19.70 19.28 19.11 19.05

  10 bits
  history  SSE                        haproxy                    maillog
    512    4.11 4.15 4.14 4.14        48.68 48.51 48.77 49.44    36.52 36.53 36.70 36.70
   1024    4.01 4.06 4.08 4.09        39.95 39.64 39.79 40.30    30.57 30.66 30.90 30.75
